<http://data.silknow.org/object/1c6ecc51-d006-3ee7-b72c-4dcb8cce1221>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Tapestry woven in wool and silk, Brussels, ca. 1690-1720"@en , "Tapestry woven in wool and silk. On the left is seated a women personifying Autumn. In her left hand she holds a large staff wreathed with vine leaves, which a girl is supporting. Before her kneels a woman who offers her a cornucopia filled with grapes and fruit. Before her are fruits, metal wine jugs and metal dishes with fruit. On the ground on her left is seated a woman holding bunches of grapes and another woman advances towards her bearing a large dish on which are grapes and fruits. In the foreground, a woman is seated and holds up a tall dish with fruits and she rests her left arm on a large basket full of fruit. There are trees to the right and left and in the distance is a hillside with vineyards showing grapes being gathered."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/a7427b44-3743-3f6e-8292-d678954252c2> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/bb80b107-c22d-3503-8934-6cb7bc303157> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Tapestry woven in wool and silk. On the left is seated a women personifying Autumn. In her left hand she holds a large staff wreathed with vine leaves, which a girl is supporting. Before her kneels a woman who offers her a cornucopia filled with grapes and fruit. Before her are fruits, metal wine jugs and metal dishes with fruit. On the ground on her left is seated a woman holding bunches of grapes and another woman advances towards her bearing a large dish on which are grapes and fruits. In the foreground, a woman is seated and holds up a tall dish with fruits and she rests her left arm on a large basket full of fruit. There are trees to the right and left and in the distance is a hillside with vineyards showing grapes being gathered."@en , "Tapestry woven in wool and silk, Brussels, ca. 1690-1720"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/1c6ecc51-d006-3ee7-b72c-4dcb8cce1221/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/1c6ecc51-d006-3ee7-b72c-4dcb8cce1221/dimension/2> ;
